    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents dynamics that are independent of mass. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="class_non_mass_based_dynamics" kindref="compound">NonMassBasedDynamics</ref> is a subclass of <ref refid="class_dynamics" kindref="compound">Dynamics</ref> for behaviors that are not influenced by the mass of the organism or resource. This class is abstract and should be subclassed to implement specific non-mass-dependent dynamic behaviors. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
